juanfont/headscale/git/commits/2174f6d0b982a4b7787b86319f236d8eeb9b923b","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/2174f6d0b982a4b7787b86319f236d8eeb9b923b"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEETsg2zODHWfdLQs6Li8B/uf6u72MFAmixwBcACgkQi8B/uf6u\n72My6hAAiJuW5SIAxgP6KGJJgrd0YdFn94s49O6aKM4gEs4Om/EMALP3QhrlKQk5\nla9kzAVyD3VITuXSWE0UXF0JTmGtGkh+gp0TqHTNLkmGRJ8MNu1BlEYSGanxirHv\nDa93ZF35BG0qbVh19BfaJt8KvhistZ/YcWziNrafePTb/Of8z1mB4XiG5+s30wU/\nYXgINu+h7hROeWWoCncHcpwFdTwxr3D71alrPUAoEwe/EV2OWwobxRYkvE/ifD3S\nzV/QhthjnLh1/WVmKCIJBt6RrwZIV3AVYVRY6qUMTpU82f9tsNKLPa7KYsant+hR\nPInKxkDCABhbvFoSXE76opRXZRj7F8hW774h12kOJlNbyCLhwXi4GabTZV64AhSL\nIvx0v+cKxV57AqzL5C1yURiN2yJr/67xJAMsSSVNgNdEHJM8vzJYyf6CVFo9Y7cR\nrp3nYl1keUIyLWz93Z1znyyNthDWTblyv9YTxC9gK7hs6ay0obLH9eo6OtclUV0b\nHyaUmWTOsSJAERapCtkfLPCBw5bul6CTGzQqVdwS3dzHHrdbvmofCzkDmFv8TJVh\nWYFOdQRhcmm3WYrgWlUVLMx2gzHLquBQXv6ZPUcUmjVn3zK91AiTk7HE/2JUyKlE\nEkDCGKlUlaMQjD/NJyFqhumnNWkhIcUpWQEo72FVtaiIqDYgfQE=\n=arzX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 20a2be67851445a720e838b2e9566a9681b3f9f7\nparent 2174f6d0b982a4b7787b86319f236d8eeb9b923b\nauthor Andrey Bobelev <andrey@bobelev.com> 1756475742 +0200\ncommitter Andrey Bobelev <andrey@bobelev.com> 1756479509 +0200\n\nfix: return valid AuthUrl in followup request on expired reg id\n\n- tailscale client gets a new AuthUrl and sets entry in the regcache\n- regcache entry expires\n- client doesn't know about that\n- client always polls followup request а gets error\n\nWhen user clicks \"Login\" in the app (after cache expiry), they visit\ninvalid URL and get \"node not found in registration cache\". Some clients\non Windows for e.g. can't get a new AuthUrl without restart the app.\n\nTo fix that we can issue a new reg id and return user a new valid\nAuthUrl.\n","verified_at":"2025-08-29T14:59:03Z"},"event":"committed"},{"id":19413515840,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887IstCAzwAAAASFIr5A","url":